# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — OHOS 系统 bash (CONFIG_SHELL) 在 HMDFS 上 getcwd 失败 ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-09-09
# Software: classads 1.0.10（所有 autotools 包在 profile buildenv 注入 CONFIG_SHELL 时）
# Gate: conan create build() / configure
# Status: UNMATCHED — needs human/AI review to promote to E-entry

id:                     E1942
title: profile buildenv 注入的 CONFIG_SHELL（OHOS 系统 bash）在 HMDFS 目录 getcwd 失败，configure 全程风暴后死于 cannot run bash ./config.sub
trigger_tool: autoconf / configure
phase: configuration
error_signature: error retrieving current directory: getcwd|cannot run .*bash \./config\.sub|shell-init: error retrieving current directory
severity:               3
category:               platform, autotools, toolchain
match_keywords: getcwd, CONFIG_SHELL, hmdfs, job-working-directory, config.sub,
  cannot run bash, shell-init, error retrieving current directory, configure
root_cause: profile [buildenv] 注入 CONFIG_SHELL=/data/service/hnp/bin/bash（OHOS 系统
  bash）；该 bash 对 HMDFS 挂载目录的 getcwd() 返回 ENOTSUP/EINVAL（非负载问题：同目录
  SSH 手动 pwd 正常、低负载时同样失败）。autoconf 一旦采用 CONFIG_SHELL，config.guess/
  config.sub/conftest 全链路 getcwd 失败（一次构建可刷数百条 "job-working-directory:
  error retrieving current directory"），死于 `cannot run bash ./config.sub`。
rec_approach: configshell-inline-binsh + in-source-build
verification_cmd:
  test_package 实跑通过（conan-verify G2 PASS，2026-09-09）；未修复前 100% 复现。
rec_auto_fix:               false
rec_impl:               manual
rec_priority:               1
last_updated:               2026-10-17
authors:               unknown
doc_file:               doc/E1942.md
affected_scope:         profile buildenv 注入的 CONFIG_SHELL（OHOS 系统 bash）在 HMDFS 目录 ge
verification_cmd:       # 以 source_pr CI 门禁为准（PR n/a）
rec_description:        configshell-inline-binsh + in-source-build
